                                    "id": "id_145_1780848096038",
                                    "type": "richText",
                                    "content": "<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"208\"><strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"208\">Rich Text Content:</strong></p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1mem5yw\" data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"231\">Introduction to AWS</h1>\n<p data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"406\">Amazon Web Services (AWS) is the world's leading cloud computing platform that provides on-demand computing resources, storage, databases, networking, and security services.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4zon9n\" data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"435\">What is Cloud Computing?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"632\">Cloud computing is the delivery of computing services over the internet. Instead of owning physical servers and infrastructure, users can access resources as needed from cloud providers like AWS.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"120tgbx\" data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"652\">Benefits of AWS</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"791\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1khmjoh\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"683\">\nScalability and Flexibility\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mg7e9j\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"703\">\nHigh Availability\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1nc0ad8\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"727\">\nPay-as-you-go Pricing\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q4a31g\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"751\">\nGlobal Infrastructure\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mphm6o\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"771\">\nEnhanced Security\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wm0y14\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"791\">\nAutomatic Backups\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sb7iad\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"813\">AWS Core Services</h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14thr1g\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"829\">Amazon EC2</h3>\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"893\">Provides virtual servers in the cloud for running applications.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gay41c\" data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">Amazon S3</h3>\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"979\">Object storage service for storing files, images, videos, and backups.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1u8lpeu\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"992\">AWS IAM</h3>\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1076\">Identity and Access Management service for controlling user access and permissions.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14thb79\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1092\">Amazon RDS</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1129\">Managed relational database service.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14theut\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1145\">Amazon VPC</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1195\">Virtual networking environment for AWS resources.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19wzotk\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1218\">Amazon CloudWatch</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1268\">Monitoring and logging service for AWS resources.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10irhbc\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1290\">Learning Outcomes</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1342\">After completing this lesson, you will understand:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1452\">\n<li data-section-id=\"11u2xkt\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1373\">\nCloud computing fundamentals\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"udx09t\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1401\">\nAWS global infrastructure\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"acbku0\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1421\">\nCore AWS services\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l1b502\" data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1452\">\nBenefits of cloud technology</li></ul>"
